108 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (Now, Hobbes tried to apply those two methods to questions about human nature. But in doing so, he wanted to be consistent with the achievements of Galilean physics. This is the first point where you can see that we are departing from our readings.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
